flowchart LR
  DEV[Developer] --> BUILD[docker build]
  BUILD --> ACR[Azure Container Registry]
  ACR --> ACA[Container Apps x5]
  ACR --> AKS[AKS Deployments<br/>k8s/azure/]
  EH[(Event Hubs)] --> ACA
  EH --> AKS
  ST[Storage Blob] --> ACA
  AZ[Azurite in-cluster] --> AKS
  ING[Ingress NGINX] --> AKS
